	<h3>Academic and institutional lectures</h3>
	<ul>
	<li>10th AIEE Energy Symposium, "Current and Future Challenges to Energy Security" (Italian Association of Energy Economists and University of Turin), Turin, 25–26 November 2026: accepted paper, "Political Grammars of Energy Security: France, Taiwan and the United Arab Emirates". I compare France, Taiwan and the United Arab Emirates to understand how governments and operators make an energy choice acceptable, where standard energy security indicators describe material risks. <a href="https://www.aieesymposium.eu/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">The symposium →</a></li>
