<div class="hp-feature ip-card">
	<h3>HEIP lecture series</h3>
	<p>Series of lectures on energy geopolitics at HEIP (Hautes Études Internationales et Politiques), alongside regular teaching. Regular interventions before students on current topics: energy crises, electrical sovereignty, transitions in Asia and Africa.</p>
</div>

<div class="hp-feature ip-card">
	<h3>Université Ouverte de la Duchère</h3>
	<p>Monthly public lecture series I founded within the Lyon La Duchère football club, in partnership with Ciné Duchère. The concept: each month, a guest — academic, artist, intellectual — addresses residents of the working-class Duchère neighbourhood in Lyon, followed by a discussion and a film screening.</p>
	<p>Inaugurated in November 2022 with mathematician Cédric Villani. Past guests include Catou Faust (EM Lyon Business School). The series combines academic rigour with grassroots engagement, as an exercise in democratising knowledge.</p>
</div>

